# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — Stiffstream 系仓库构建树位于顶层 dev/ 子目录 ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-22
# Software: json_dto 0.3.4
# Gate: G2 conan create（clean build）
# Status: UNMATCHED — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry
# Source PR: OpenHarmonyPCDeveloper/build_in_harmonyos (feat/json_dto-0.3.4, 待创建)
#
# To promote:
#   1. Review the error excerpt below
#   2. Rename to E0XX.kv and move to knowledge/graph/
#   3. Add a row to knowledge/graph/index.tsv

id: DRAFT-json_dto-0.3.4-dev-subdir-build-tree-flatten
severity: 2
category: build-system|conan|cmake|source-layout|stiffstream|strip_root
trigger_tool: conan|conan-create|conan-verify|cmake|ohc-run.py conan-verify
phase: source|configuration

keywords: dev/ subdirectory, build tree in dev/, CMakeLists.txt not at source root,
   strip_root, Stiffstream, json_dto, RESTinio, archive refs tags, tag tarball,
   flatten source, G2 conan create fail, does not appear to contain CMakeLists.txt

error_signature: >-
  The source directory .* does not appear to contain CMakeLists\.txt|
  Error in build\(\) method.*cmake\.configure\(\)|
  CMake Error: The source directory .* does not appear to contain|
  Sources correctly downloaded from .*archive/refs/tags|Uncompressing .* to \.

match_keywords: >-
  dev/ subdirectory, build tree, CMakeLists.txt, strip_root, Stiffstream, json_dto,
  RESTinio, tag tarball, flatten, source root, G2, conan create, not at source root

root_cause: >-
  Stiffstream 系仓库（json_dto 0.3.4，同类还有 RESTinio 等）把实际工程源码放在仓库根
  的 dev/ 子目录（dev/CMakeLists.txt、dev/json_dto/、dev/test/、dev/sample/、
  dev/cmake/），仓库根只有 LICENSE/README.md/THANKS/externals.rb 等外围文件。
  GitHub archive/refs/tags/v.0.3.4.tar.gz 顶层是 json_dto-v.0.3.4/，conan
  get(strip_root=True) 只剥一层，源码根为 dev/ 内容上移但 dev/ 本身未剥离 →
  CMakeLists.txt 实际在 <source_root>/dev/ 下，cmake.configure() 用源码根找不到项目
  文件而失败。init-build 本地 work 目录已做过同样扁平化（json_dto-0.3.4.work 根目录
  直接是 CMakeLists.txt），故本地手工 cmake 可过而 conan 缓存干净构建失败。

rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: flatten-dev-dir-in-source
rec_description: >-
  source() 中 get(strip_root=True) 之后检测顶层 dev/ 目录并 shutil.move 其内容到
  源码根再 rmtree(dev/)，无需改上游源码或加补丁；package()/package_info() 按扁平化后
  的 source_folder/json_dto/*.hpp 布局工作。
rec_command: >-
  def source(self):
      get(self, **self.conan_data["sources"], strip_root=True)
      dev = os.path.join(self.source_folder, "dev")
      if os.path.isdir(dev):
          for item in os.listdir(dev):
              shutil.move(os.path.join(dev, item), self.source_folder)
          shutil.rmtree(dev)
rec_auto_fix: true
rec_impl: conan-source-flatten-dev-dir
verification_cmd: >-
  python3 scripts/ohc-run.py conan-verify json_dto 0.3.4  （G2 conan create PASS，
  且上游 20 ctest 目标 711 断言全过）

fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: configure-source-folder-dev
fallback_description: >-
  不扁平化源码，改为在 generate()/configure 阶段把 CMake 源码目录指向
  <source_root>/dev/（CMake(self).configure() 的源码目录参数或 toolchain source_folder）。
fallback_command: >-
  cmake -S <source_root>/dev -B build  （conan 侧通过 generate() 设置
  tc.variables 或 configure(source_folder=...) 实现）
fallback_auto_fix: false
fallback_impl:

forbid_1_pattern: rm -rf dev
forbid_1_reason: 不得在未扁平化前直接删除 dev/，否则丢失全部源码
forbid_1_consequence: CMakeLists.txt 及源码丢失，构建必然失败

principles: R6 只改源文件不改生成文件（source() 内布局处理不落 diff）；R12 失败先匹配
  错误模式再动手
causes:
caused_by:
similar_to: E195（init-build _promote_nested_source 提升 src/ 丢同级目录，根因不同）;
  E092/E267（cmake 平台检测，dev/ 仅为 grep 上下文）
conflicts_with:
